Package: devjam-thunar-actions
Version: 3.5-6
Section: xfce
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Recommends: thunar, thunar-archive-plugin, thunar-gtkhash, catfish, imagemagick, zenity, mediainfo-gui, gnupg, gnupg2, baobab, inotify-tools, pacpl, meld, genisoimage, mkvtoolnix, cfourcc, mediainfo, ffmpeg, devjam-tools, fclones, zstd
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Thunar custom actions collection
 Collection of Thunar custom actions for audio and video conversion,
 images, archives, duplicate checks, file comparison and MATLAB. A
 wrapper diverts /usr/bin/thunar and merges the system and user actions
 into ~/.config/Thunar/uca.xml before Thunar starts.
